d 'FF': module to browse and search Stata's built-in functions
d
d	ff browses and searches Stata's built-in functions.  It
d reads the function documentation    shipped with your copy of
d Stata, so the list always matches the Stata version you are	
d running.  No Internet connection is needed and nothing is
d hard-coded. 
d
d KW: online help
d KW: functions
d
d Requires: Stata version 11
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260921
d
d Author: Wu LiangHai,  Anhui University of Technology
d Support: email agd2010@@yeah.net
d
d Author:   Wu Hanyan, Nanjing University of Aeronautics and Astronautics
d Support: email    2325476320@@qq.com
d
f ff.ado
f ff.sthlp
